    "show_share": true,
    "description": "AKU's Chair of Paediatrics & Child Health, Dr Fyezah Jehan, has been selected as a Distinguished International Fellow of the prestigious American Society of Tropical Medicine and Hygiene for her accomplishments in research, advocacy and service for malnourished mothers, children and infectious diseases.",
